5. COMPLETE FASTAPI ENDPOINT CONTRACT

Authentication:
• POST /api/auth/login -> Authenticate Staff/Kitchen/Owner and return JWT token.
• POST /api/auth/register -> [Owner] Create new Staff, Kitchen, or Owner account.
Tables & Floor Map:
• GET /api/tables -> Fetch live status & points for tables T1–T6.
• GET /api/tables/verify-qr -> [Public] Validate table_number and qr_token from URL.
• PATCH /api/tables/{table_id}/status -> [Staff] Manually update table floor status.
Menu Management:
• GET /api/menu -> [Public] List menu items with filters (category, veg, allergen, search).
• POST /api/menu -> [Owner] Add a new dish to the menu.
• PATCH /api/menu/{item_id} -> [Owner] Edit dish price, details, or toggle availability.
• DELETE /api/menu/{item_id} -> [Owner] Remove a dish from the menu.
Order Lifecycle & KDS:
• POST /api/orders -> [Public] Customer places a new order from QR menu.
• GET /api/orders/table/{table_id} -> [Public] Fetch live order status & countdown timer for table.
• PATCH /api/orders/{order_id}/confirm -> [Staff] Confirm customer order and send to KDS.
• GET /api/kds/active -> [Kitchen] Fetch active items grouped by Tandoor, Curry, Drinks.
• PATCH /api/kds/items/{item_id}/status -> [Kitchen] Update item status (Cooking -> Ready).
• PATCH /api/orders/{order_id}/served -> [Staff] Mark ready order as Served (clears from KDS).
Call Waiter Alerts:
• POST /api/alerts -> [Public] Customer triggers Call Waiter (Water, Napkins, Bill, Help).
• GET /api/alerts/pending -> [Staff] Fetch active unacknowledged table alerts.
• PATCH /api/alerts/{alert_id}/resolve -> [Staff] Resolve alert and record response_seconds.
Billing, Payments & Reviews:
• POST /api/bills/generate/{table_id} -> [Public/Staff] Generate itemized bill with GST & tip.
• POST /api/payments -> [Public/Staff] Record full or split payment; resets table when paid.
• POST /api/reviews -> [Public] Submit post-payment 1–5 star rating and comment.
Guest Engagement & Owner Analytics:
• GET /api/engagement/{table_id} -> [Public] Fetch WiFi credentials, reward points & Table Leaderboard.
• POST /api/engagement/quiz-submit -> [Public] Award points for Spice Quiz answers.
• GET /api/analytics/summary -> [Owner] Fetch KPIs, live sales chart data, top dishes & waiter SLA metrics.

